### WorkerMessage API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Create a new Worker Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/workermessages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Expert Craftsmanship",
  "description": "Our team of skilled artisans brings decades of experience to every project, ensuring premium quality cast stone products that exceed expectations.",
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753086-00f18fb6b3ea?w=1200&h=600&fit=crop",
  "collectionId": 1,
  "createdBy": "admin@example.com"
}

### Get all Worker Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/workermessages

### Get Worker Message by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/workermessages/1

### Get Worker Message by Collection ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/workermessages/collection/1

### Get all Active Worker Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/workermessages/active/all

### Update Worker Message
PUT {{baseUrl}}/workermessages/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "heading": "Premium Quality Assurance",
  "description": "Every cast stone piece undergoes rigorous quality checks to ensure it meets our exacting standards for durability and beauty.",
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753086-00f18fb6b3ea?w=1200&h=600&fit=crop",
  "collectionId": 1,
  "isActive": true,
  "updatedBy": "admin@example.com"
}

### Delete Worker Message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/workermessages/1

